WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.354
When a pod breaks at two in the
morning, the fastest command is delete.

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.918
It's also the one that
destroys your evidence.

3
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:10.584
Meet kube-noob.

4
00:00:10.584 --> 00:00:12.238
There's no AI inside it.

5
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.219
Your AI does the talking.

6
00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:20.758
kube-noob supplies the rules, the
read-only steps and the citations.

7
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.340
Free and open source.

8
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.193
Get it at kube-noob dot com.
